{
  "case_id": "CC-DBLCLICK-1.20.1",
  "title": "选卡界面 §9-1：4 张同种牌双击 → 恰好 1 张进卡槽、余量留原槽（回归 put_filled=3）；双击卡槽取回",
  "version": "1.20.1",
  "target": {
    "type": "feature",
    "ref": "card-choice-screen"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "token 2200 场景：hotbar0 战斗牌(中)x4，hotbar1 战斗牌(大)x2；两次双击均由客户端探针在同一 tick 内连发 click/rel/click/rel（<280ms 窗口）。关键判据 = 一次双击只搬 1 张（CardChoiceMenu#quickMoveStack 只 moveItemStackTo(copyWithCount(1))）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamemode creative",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralcc2 prep dbl",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralcc2 open 3 combat 2200",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 16000
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralcc2 close",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    }
  ],
  "asserts": [
